OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry with
OL,6,Fclear spells this evening. However,
OL,7,Fcloud will be increasing from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest, with bands of mostly light
OL,9,Frain moving southeastwards across all
OL,10,Fparts overnight. Windy. Generally mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly cloud and outbreaks of
OL,13,Frain in the east will soon clear to
OL,14,Fleave a largely dry and bright day,
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells. Breezy.
OL,16,FTemperatures near average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
